# welcome-route (h10-t-route): the welcome page at the root route at 1440 x 900, density 2,
# on a dark system in Arctic Ice. Time 0 is the first frame; reduced motion holds the hero
# still, so the shot waits 2 s.
route welcome
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
shot welcome-route
